  "details": "A new button in the [Here] tab (or other suitable part) of the Quick Menu that removes all prints summoned by the local user.\n\nAs one can only place one sticker at a time in an instance & as they do not move after placement, this is less necessary for stickers.\n\nEquivalently, the Radial Menu displays which items/props are active, making it convenient to remove all those active.\n\nBut for prints, the only current way to reliably mass remove all one's summoned prints is to rejoin the instance, which is a bit overkill in my opinion.\n\nSince prints can also be picked up and thrown etc., selecting the print's in-world bubble can be prohibitively impractical, as is resummoning each print just to delete it.",
